  <demo name="brd2603a.demo.zwave_soc_door_lock_keypad" label="Z-Wave - SoC Door Lock Keypad">
    <model:description>The Z-Wave certified Door Lock application shows a lock implementation. It will support user codes to open a door and thereby eliminate the need for traditional keys. It is possible to both lock and unlock the door remotely through the Z-Wave protocol.
For certain devices, the application supports and uses the User Credential Command Class. See README file for details.
</model:description>
